<title>GERMANY: Bundesbank does not plan news conference.</title>
<headline>Bundesbank does not plan news conference.</headline>
<dateline>FRANKFURT 1997-05-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Bundesbank said on Thursday it does not plan to hold a news conference after its regular fortnightly council meeting.</p>
<p>Bundesbank President Hans Tietmeyer will chair the meeting. The central bank is widely expected to leave German interest rates unchanged.</p>
<p>--Frankfurt Newsroom + 49 69 756525</p>
